{"articleNo":"2531","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2531&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"여름계절수업 개(폐)강 과목 공고 및 추가등록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.05.31","hit":"13910","attachments":[{"name":"폐강과목 수강정정 신청서(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2531&attachNo=1457"},{"name":"2010 여름계절수업 개설과목표1.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2531&attachNo=1803"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2010 여름 계절수업 개설 및 폐강과목 공고 및 추가 등록 안내&nbsp;<br><br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 2010 여름계절수업 개설 및 폐강과목을 붙임과 같이 공고하오니,<br><br>&nbsp; 폐강과목 수강자는 수강정정신청을 하시기 바라며,&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp; 추가신청 하여야 할 학생은 아래기한내에 신청하시기 바랍니다.<br><br><br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; <font color=\"#800080\">폐강교과목 : 기계공작법, 기계공학입문&nbsp; 2개 강좌&nbsp;<br></font><br><br>&nbsp; -&nbsp; 폐강과목 수강정정 기간 :&nbsp; 2010. 5. 31(월) ~ 6. 3(목)&nbsp; 12 : 00&nbsp;까지 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;붙임 서식작성 교무연구과(글로벌관 456호 제출) <br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp; 졸업대상자로서 추가 신규신청자&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp; 2010. 6. 1(화)까지 붙임 서식에 담당교수님 승인을 득한후<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교무연구과(글로벌관 456호)&nbsp;로 제출&nbsp;<br><br><br>&nbsp; <font color=\"#ff0000\">-&nbsp;&nbsp; 수강료 납부일자&nbsp; : 2010. 6. 3(목) 하루만&nbsp;오후 4시까지 수납 <br></font><br>&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;납부방법&nbsp; : &nbsp;원스톱에서 고지서 출력, 농협(전국지점, 가상계좌) 납부<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>붙임&nbsp; 1. 2010 여름계절수업 개설과목표 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2.&nbsp; 폐강과목 수강정정 신청서식 1부.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br><br><br><br>&nbsp;<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
